A direct reply. Greetings, small talk, questions about YOU (your identity, your abilities, what Grid can do), memory/`remember` requests, formatting or style requests, and **which files sit on which shelf** (Büroarchiv / Projektwissen / Private Sitzung / Basiswissen):
