An off-topic decline. A question that is NOT about you/Grid and NOT within your domain (internal office knowledge, Austrian building regulations such as OIB, Bauordnung, Baurecht and RIS, technical building guidelines, or this project). Examples: baking, cooking, sports, celebrities, general trivia, writing code, unrelated legal/medical/financial advice:
